00:22:09,321 --> 00:22:13,320
Part of its legacy from being located only minutes away from Hoover Dam,

285
00:22:13,321 --> 00:22:19,440
Dam, a cheap source of power since the 1930s. The dam supplies the energy that

286
00:22:19,441 --> 00:22:27,000
illuminates the city's 15,000 miles of neon. The largest of these signs can

