00:23:14,361 --> 00:23:16,860
It's then put out into the shop.

298
00:23:16,861 --> 00:23:19,400
We manufacture it.

299
00:23:19,401 --> 00:23:21,500
On the larger signs, they'll only come together

300
00:23:21,501 --> 00:23:23,680
the first time on the site.

301
00:23:23,681 --> 00:23:26,540
Everything we do is in pieces so we can transport it

302
00:23:26,541 --> 00:23:27,680
to the site.

303
00:23:27,681 --> 00:23:30,540
It's then assembled, and the first time it's ever fully

304
00:23:30,541 --> 00:23:32,420
working is at the site.

305
00:23:33,620 --> 00:23:41,900
In the competitive world of signage, there is a natural desire to create the biggest, the best, and the brightest.

306
00:23:43,040 --> 00:23:50,340
Yesco's classic creations include the world's largest Indian headdress, which adorns Buffalo Bills at the Nevada State Line,

307
00:23:50,341 --> 00:23:56,600
and the world's largest Gibson guitar, which welcomes patrons to Las Vegas' Hard Rock Cafe.

308
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:59,700
Each sign is a unique challenge.

309
00:23:59,701 --> 00:24:03,920
When you manufacture a neon tube, it starts out as a straight tube of glass.

310
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:09,300
As the tubing is bent, you have to put a little air pressure into the tube.

311
00:24:09,900 --> 00:24:12,040
So when you see the man with the tube in his mouth,

312
00:24:12,300 --> 00:24:16,640
what he's doing is applying a small amount of air pressure so the bends don't collapse.

313
00:24:17,100 --> 00:24:19,480
So they're a nice, even, clean bend.

314
00:24:20,060 --> 00:24:24,380
Neon actually has a lot of lumen output for the size of the tube.

315
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:26,300
So you get a very intense light.

316
00:24:26,301 --> 00:24:29,320
You have a number of different colors that you can create with neon.

317
00:24:29,700 --> 00:24:38,600
Plus it lends itself to be able to be flashed or the sequence of going off and on very rapidly without having to warm the tube up.

318
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:47,440
The exacting craft of creating a neon sign sparks a close personal relationship between the artist and his art.

319
00:24:49,140 --> 00:24:55,520
When you go through the design work, the manufacturer, and see it take shape and actually out on the site

