00:24:55,521 --> 00:24:59,540
in all of the flashing action and all of the lights and everything,

321
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:02,460
it almost takes on a life of its own.

322
00:25:03,040 --> 00:25:05,240
And it's hard when we lose a piece.

323
00:25:06,060 --> 00:25:08,500
The Dunes, for example, when that went down,

324
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:12,720
we lost a piece of Las Vegas that can never be replaced.

325
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:16,520
When Las Vegas resort impresario Steve Wynn

326
00:25:16,521 --> 00:25:20,920
decided to remove the famous Dunes Hotel to make way for a new project,

