00:25:29,121 --> 00:25:32,020
Had all of the neon working, all of the lights working.

330
00:25:32,021 --> 00:25:34,620
It looked as good as it ever had looked.

331
00:25:34,621 --> 00:25:37,260
It was the opening of the Treasure Island that evening.

332
00:25:37,261 --> 00:25:40,060
So the first shots fired from the cannon

333
00:25:40,061 --> 00:25:42,140
were simulated going down the strip.

334
00:25:42,141 --> 00:25:44,240
And when they landed, they landed on the dunes.

335
00:25:44,241 --> 00:25:46,240
And at that point, it was imploded.

336
00:25:55,520 --> 00:26:02,520
Like a Viking burial at sea, Las Vegas history leaves this world in a blaze of glory.

337
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:12,520
But for the crew at Young Electric, many memories of old triumphs are entombed in the backyard.

338
00:26:12,521 --> 00:26:17,520
Most every sign company has a boneyard or a graveyard where they keep old signs.

