00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:26,100
I think that it was just good business decisions

431
00:34:26,101 --> 00:34:29,660
by the owners and the political leaders

432
00:34:29,661 --> 00:34:34,060
to bring this about so as to present an image of harmony,

433
00:34:34,061 --> 00:34:36,340
even if it was only a facade.

434
00:34:36,341 --> 00:34:38,020
What tourists would want to visit an area

435
00:34:38,021 --> 00:34:43,040
where turmoil might be going on?

436
00:34:43,041 --> 00:34:45,040
As the veil of segregation lifted,

437
00:34:45,041 --> 00:34:48,040
it revealed another hypocrisy.

438
00:34:48,041 --> 00:34:50,700
For a long time, the hotels would take our money

