00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:06,920
So blacks could only work at the very lowest level of jobs.

445
00:35:06,980 --> 00:35:08,860
Even in the South, they were more liberal, at least.

446
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:11,840
In the South, they had black bartenders, black waiters, and so forth,

447
00:35:11,841 --> 00:35:13,380
but not in Las Vegas.

448
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:16,480
So integration had a kind of a two-fold effect.

449
00:35:17,140 --> 00:35:20,880
We gained something morally, but we probably lost something economically.

450
00:35:20,881 --> 00:35:29,000
The Moulin Rouge was designed to offer African Americans an alternative, as well as bridge the racial gap.

451
00:35:29,660 --> 00:35:31,360
But its role was short-lived.

452
00:35:31,361 --> 00:35:37,120
From 1955 to 1985, this place, surprisingly, it reverted.

