00:35:37,580 --> 00:35:39,240
It was never owned by black people.

454
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:40,540
That's the first thing.

455
00:35:40,600 --> 00:35:41,780
It was built by whites.

456
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:48,660
And after its closure, it reverted back to being a segregated club.

457
00:35:48,980 --> 00:35:50,040
They only had a bar.

458
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:55,140
but it didn't cater to blacks, and they had a history of discrimination.

459
00:35:56,600 --> 00:35:59,720
Eventually, the Civil Rights Movement changed the face of the nation,

460
00:36:00,240 --> 00:36:04,360
and racial segregation was declared illegal as well as immoral.

461
00:36:05,300 --> 00:36:12,260
I think it behooves Las Vegas to involve all people in its success,

462
00:36:12,580 --> 00:36:18,000
and I particularly take great pride in doing that because I grew up here.

463
00:36:18,001 --> 00:36:24,000
I've lived here for 50 years, and I want to be a part of making Las Vegas what I think it should be.

